{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Frequently Asked Questions"}], "prev": {"link": "../using-the-same-file-id-across-different-accounts/", "title": "Using the same file_id across different accounts"}, "next": {"link": "../client-started-but-nothing-happens/", "title": "Client started, but nothing happens"}, "title": "Using multiple clients at once on the same account", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"using-multiple-clients-at-once-on-the-same-account\">\n<h1>Using multiple clients at once on the same account<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#using-multiple-clients-at-once-on-the-same-account\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>User accounts are able to run multiple sessions in parallel. However, you must not use the same session in more than one client at the same time.\nThe correct way to run multiple clients on the same account is by authorizing your account from the beginning each time, or by using <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../topics/storage-engines/\"><span class=\"doc\">Storage Engines</span></a>, and use one separate session for each parallel client.</p>\n<p>It is not recommended to run multiple sessions of bot accounts simultaneously in parallel. If you choose to do so, you <strong>agree</strong> to do so at your own risk and with no liablity to anything.</p>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["faq/client-started-but-nothing-happens", "Client started, but nothing happens", "N", "next"], ["faq/using-the-same-file-id-across-different-accounts", "Using the same file_id across different accounts", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Using multiple clients at once on the same account</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "faq/using-multiple-clients-at-once-on-the-same-account", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}